    "reviews": "\u201cReturning to a game in this style felt like coming home.\u201d<br>IGN<br><br>\u201cIt appears that Heartbound will be a game that'll tug at the heartstrings and more by the time of its release, which, judging by the title, seems just right.\u201d<br>Game Skinny<br><br>\u201cI really really like it! I can't wait to see more of this!\u201d<br>Jack Septic Eye<br>",
